  "kanji": "准",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 准\ntitle: quasi-; associate rank\njlpt: 1\ntags: [jlpt-n1, grade-8, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 10\nradical: 冫\nradicalNumber: 15\nonyomi: [ジュン]\nkunyomi: []\nquizOnyomi: [ジュン]\nquizKunyomi: []\ndistractors: [冴, 冶, 隼]\n---\n\n# 准 — quasi-; associate rank\n\n**Strokes:** 10 · **Key (radical):** 冫 (no. 15) · **JLPT:** N1 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n准 can mark a status corresponding to, but not fully the same as, a named rank.\nIn [准教授](../words/准教授.md) じゅんきょうじゅ, it helps name the established\nrank **associate professor**. Do not interpret it as a literal half-professor\nor a trainee awaiting automatic promotion.\n\nAnother branch concerns approval: 批准 ひじゅん means ratification.\nNot every compound containing 准 is an associate rank.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** picture the bird-shaped 隹 beside\nthe two marks of 冫 as a bird standing beside a rank sign. This is an invented\nmemory scene, not an explanation of the character's historical formation.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ジュン | on | [准教授](../words/准教授.md) じゅんきょうじゅ — associate professor |\n\nThis table covers the sole on-reading in the frozen KANJIDIC2 record; that\nrecord lists no kun-readings. Readings supplied by other dictionaries do not\nchange this card's source metadata.\n\n## Common words\n\n- [准教授](../words/准教授.md) じゅんきょうじゅ — associate professor\n- 批准 ひじゅん — ratification\n\n## Notes\n\n- [準](準.md) shares ジュン and has related meanings, but its shape has 氵 at\n  the upper left and 十 below. 准 has two left-hand 冫 marks and no lower 十.\n- The spellings are not freely interchangeable in modern words: learn\n  [準備](../words/準備.md) じゅんび (preparation), [基準](../words/基準.md)\n  きじゅん (standard), and 批准 ひじゅん (ratification) as written.\n  JMdict also recognizes 準教授 じゅんきょうじゅ; the current Japanese university\n  title taught here is 准教授.\n- For look-alikes, [集](集.md) has 木 below 隹, [進](進.md) has 辶, and\n  [難](難.md) has a different, dense left-hand block. Their meanings are not\n  associate rank or approval.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), database 2026-306, 2026-11-02 (EDRDG; [CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)).\nWords: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 2178020, 1483390, 1341670 and 1591210.\nCharacter senses: [Digital Daijisen: 准](https://kotobank.jp/word/准-529640).\nRank usage: [Nipponica and 大学事典: 准教授](https://kotobank.jp/word/准教授-182867).\n",
